@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Filling : low switch dry
Filling --> Idle : high switch wet
Idle --> SensorConflict : high wet, low dry
Filling --> SensorConflict : high wet, low dry
SensorConflict --> Idle : conflict cleared\n(one scan, pump off)

state Filling : fill_pump ON
state Idle : fill_pump OFF
state SensorConflict : fill_pump OFF

note as N
If either level input is unavailable,
the phase is kept unchanged.
end note
@enduml
